meta {
  name: Update Branch Radiology Test
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-radiology-tests/{{branchRadiologyTestId}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

vars:pre-request {
  branchRadiologyTestId: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

body:json {
  {
    "listPrice": 4800,
    "priceMsrp": 4800,
    "priceMaximum": 4500,
    "priceMinimum": 3200,
    "isContrast": true,
    "isHideInOrderScreen": false,
    "scheduleDays": ["MONDAY", "TUESDAY", "WEDNESDAY"],
    "scheduleFrom": "08:00",
    "scheduleTo": "18:00",
    "remarks": "Branch-specific pricing"
  }
}

docs {
  Edit a branch radiology test's **branch-tunable** fields (display name, aka,
  bodyPart, view, isContrast, priority, pricing incl. `listPrice`, TAT, schedule,
  flags, notes, active). Business JWT. Identity (`testName`/`testCode`) is fixed at
  import (it is the branch-unique key and the copy's link to its source);
  classification is managed via re-import/sync. Prices are integer minor units;
  cross-field price ordering is enforced by the DB CHECK constraints → 422 on
  violation. Note: a later **sync** overwrites these edits.

  404 `BRANCH_RADIOLOGY_TEST_NOT_FOUND` if the id isn't a live row in the active
  branch. 400 `ACTIVE_BRANCH_REQUIRED` if the JWT has no active branch.
}
